[Observation]:
  - Static routes configured on both routers enable seamless Layer 3 packet forwarding.
  - TTL was decremented at each router hop (initial TTL 128 -> received TTL 126).
  - Two collision domains per LAN and a point-to-point WAN link were successfully orchestrated.
